    ProofCLI -->|enter lock context before _connect| LockFile
    LockFile -->|acquire on lock file descriptor| PlatformLock
    PlatformLock -->|lock acquired before database open| WorkspaceDB
    ProofCLI ==>|serialized proof_artifacts INSERT + commit while lock held| WorkspaceDB
    WorkspaceDB -->|close connection, then unlock| PlatformLock

